...@../../_tools/theme
direction: down
grid-rows: 3

front: "브라우저 쪽" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 3
  user: 사용자 { class: person }
  ui: Streamlit UI (autorag.py) { class: ours }
  pdf: 업로드 PDF { class: file }
}

agent_box: AutoRAG 에이전트 (auto_rag_agent) { class: ours }

backend: "외부 연동" {
  class: group
  grid-columns: 4
  openai: OpenAI API (GPT-4o-mini · 임베딩) { class: ext }
  ddg: DuckDuckGo 웹 검색 { class: ext }
  docs: auto_rag_docs (:5532) { class: store }
  sess: auto_rag_storage (:5532) { class: store }
}

front -> agent_box: PDF · 질문 텍스트
agent_box -> backend: 모델·검색 호출 · 벡터/세션 읽고쓰기
